268
00:10:11,342 --> 00:10:14,103
That is the clearest statement of intent

269
00:10:14,103 --> 00:10:15,139
in the sources.

270
00:10:15,489 --> 00:10:16,626
Now Porsche.

271
00:10:16,806 --> 00:10:18,987
The Drive's report on the lap does

272
00:10:18,987 --> 00:10:20,719
not mention Porsche at all.

273
00:10:20,899 --> 00:10:24,085
Motor One says the GTD's lap beat

274
00:10:24,085 --> 00:10:29,202
the Lamborghini Aventador SuperVeloce and the Ferrari

275
00:10:29,202 --> 00:10:32,581
296 GTB and matched the Porsche 918

276
00:10:32,581 --> 00:10:35,284
Spyder, with no times given.

277
00:10:35,464 --> 00:10:38,245
So at the moment of the record,

278
00:10:38,245 --> 00:10:42,103
